A message was sent to you regarding record request #26-825:

Hello,



Lane County may provide a fee waiver or reduction for people who otherwise =
would have to pay a fee for public records requests. Oregon law provides th=
at a public body may provide a full or partial fee waiver for information p=
rovided in response to a public records request if fulfilling the request w=
ould serve the public interest by primarily benefiting the general public. =
Lane County considers all factors set out in the Attorney General's Public =
Records and Meetings Manual and relevant legal authorities in reviewing ind=
ividual requests for fee waivers, including but not limited to:

* The extent of time, expense, and interference with the Department's regul=
ar business, including financial hardship on the County;

* The volume of the record(s) requested;

* The necessity to segregate exempt from non-exempt materials; and/or

* The extent to which the record requested does not further the public inte=
rest.



Please provide answers to the following questions to assist us in evaluatin=
g your fee waiver/reduction request. If your request contains sub-parts, re=
spond to the questions below with respect to each sub-part, as appropriate.



* Provide general background/mission information on the requesting individu=
al/group/organization as this information relates to public records request=
s from the County.

* Describe the purpose for which you intend to use the information/records =
requested.

* Describe your plans and ability to disseminate the information to the gen=
eral public.

* Explain how your use of the records requested will benefit the general pu=
blic.

* Explain any individual and/or private benefit derived from the disclosure=
 of the records.

* Explain how disclosure of the records would serve a commercial purpose, i=
f any.

* Provide any information that would help us evaluate your ability to pay a=
ny fees for fulfilling this request.

* Provide any other information you feel would be valuable in evaluating th=
is fee reduction/waiver request.



Thank you,

Lane County Public Records








